WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.453
Detection engineering transforms threat knowledge and operational experience into meaningful signals that support defenders.

2
00:00:07.453 --> 00:00:17.511
Effective detections depend on quality telemetry, thoughtful prioritization, operational collaboration, lifecycle maintenance, and continuous improvement.

3
00:00:17.511 --> 00:00:28.845
Success is not measured by the number of alerts generated, but by helping security teams identify, investigate, and respond to suspicious activity efficiently and effectively.
